Method. `cargo test` cannot link on this host (same as B3 and freebuff's
review). So, as for B3: a byte-exact copy of HEAD's mathd/src and
mathd/fixtures in <scratch>/b4lc (tests/ left out), and a scratch cdylib
(<scratch>/b4lc/harness) that exports parse -> differentiate -> eval_at to
wasm32-unknown-unknown. gate.mjs feeds every diff.json case through it and
applies two rules, both written in the gate, not read from the fixtures:
  committed: |got - want| <= 1e-10 * max(1, |want|)
             (mathd/tests/differentiator.rs lines 331-333)
  strict:    |got - want| <= 1e-10 * |want|, and got == 0 when want == 0
             (what diff.json's header states; the rule tests/evaluator.rs
             applies to B3)
The copy matches HEAD: `git show HEAD:<path> | cmp - <copy>` is silent for
differentiator.rs, evaluator.rs and diff.json (the working tree differs
only by CRLF). Breaks edit the copy, rebuild, run the gate, and restore the
bytes. Scripts are in the appendices. The repository was not edited.

